    "summary": "Persistent context across AI sessions that stores decisions, patterns, corrections, and notes. A harvesting engine detects signals in conversation (\"let's go with\" = decision, \"actually/no\" = correction) and writes them to a Memory MCP server with importance levels (ephemeral to permanent), expiry policies, and project scoping.\n",
